;; user's decision on queue 209's DECISION 1, (a), 2026-11-05). A package apart from arbace/py, as arbace/pyexpat is:
;; the interpreted runtime loads it the first time _ssl needs the bundle (go/arbace/py's sslFallback), so a run that
;; verifies against the host's store never loads the bundle's forms; a compiled program links it.
